### Get a league by id (take an id from GET /leagues). 200
@leagueId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

GET {{DataApi_HostAddress}}/api/{{ApiVersion}}/leagues/{{leagueId}}
Accept: application/json

### Error: no league with this id (404, Problem Details)
GET {{DataApi_HostAddress}}/api/{{ApiVersion}}/leagues/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Accept: application/json

### Error: the id is not a GUID (404, the route does not match)
GET {{DataApi_HostAddress}}/api/{{ApiVersion}}/leagues/abc
Accept: application/json
